"davvero solo una cosa."

#: src/Admin/AnalyticsDashboard.php:724
msgid ""
"No members flagged. Anomaly detection requires >500 events in 30 days AND <3 "
"distinct actions; communities below those volumes simply won't trip the "
"heuristic."
msgstr ""
